=== probe methods ===
  import                    detached positional import → BooleanNode (no LUT / no covers)
  one_symbol                expression cascade → one-symbol primes/schemata (no LUT / no covers)
  schemata_pi               PI schemata DataFrame from derived primes (no full covers)
  input_redundancy          exact k_r: force full pi_coverage (exact_k_max=k); refuses / times out when Θ(2**k) cover is too large
  input_redundancy_sample   sample covers: estimate k_r from n=8192 minterms (match covering PIs; no pi_coverage dict)
  edge_redundancy           exact r_i: force full pi_coverage (exact_k_max=k); refuses / times out when Θ(2**k) cover is too large
  edge_redundancy_sample    sample covers: estimate r_i from n=8192 minterms (match covering PIs; no pi_coverage dict)
  bias                      build dense LUT (get_bit_lut), then popcount / 2**k
  sensitivity               build dense LUT, then single-flip average sensitivity
  input_symmetry            exact k_s: build full ts_coverage over all 2**k minterms

